  "narrative": {
    "intro": "DDB Chicago has $303M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. DDB Chicago won 11 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $27.6M. Obligations are down 22.4% year over year. Historical obligations show variation across recent fiscal years: FY21 was $348M, FY22 was $363M, FY23 was $596M, FY24 was $399M, FY25 was $391M, and FY26 is $303M. The FY2026 total is a partial, fiscal year to date figure, and the largest award and expiring-contract tables use total contract values rather than obligation figures. The data points show a peak in FY23 followed by declines through FY26 to date. Stakeholders focused on contract volume should note the 11 awards this year and the reported average award size of $27.6M when comparing DDB Chicago to peers or planning capture efforts.",
